  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb ({他動詞|たどうし}). The causative/transitive form of {滑|すべ}る (to slip, slide - intransitive).\n\nVERB PAIR:\n- {滑|すべ}る (intransitive) - to slip, slide\n- {滑|すべ}らす / {滑|すべ}らせる (transitive) - to slide something, cause to slip\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {手|て}を{滑|すべ}らせて〜 - to let one's hand slip and...\n- {視線|しせん}を{滑|すべ}らせる - to let one's gaze wander/slide\n- ソリを{滑|すべ}らせる - to slide a sled",
